## What Is Unity Catalog Semantics?

Unity Catalog Semantics helps people and AI interpret data with shared meaning by defining business metrics, terms, and organizational structure.

| Component | Description | In This Lab |
|---|---|---|
| **Metric View** | A Unity Catalog object that defines KPIs in YAML. It separates measures (calculated metrics) from dimensions (analysis criteria), ensuring the same calculation logic applies regardless of how you slice the data. | Steps {{ N.sem }}.1, {{ N.sem }}.2 |
| **Domain** | An organizational unit that groups data assets by business purpose, built on Governed Tags. | Step {{ N.sem }}.3 |
| **Page** | An official definition for business terms like "{{ s.improve.pages[0].name }}" or "{{ s.improve.pages[2].name }}." Pages live in a Domain and are referenced by Genie One when answering questions. | Step {{ N.agent }}.4 |

